<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.1 pts to 684.0.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.1 pts to 684.0.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.1 points on Thursday to 684.0, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the machinery index losing the most, down 16.1 points to 838.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
